      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `c8877284bfaf22a2d72df87edcbb2ba87132de3218bf86f8c5a7b33fbf31f730--45100DO002_2014.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Recorded Crime — Victims (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2014\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 6 of 6\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 1083c22011222095e32b223cf637990388b202d4e3713ab403ba9abd1ef16e7f | missing |\n| \"Table_6\" | 3bb44b941868577a6e3fc6a20f9634d787de24df565fa0da19bcf9ae30d54a00 | missing |\n| \"Table_7\" | b27a3451027a86b871a3a9781f2035e27498eb11c2ac55a6302e3fd358c7e428 | missing |\n| \"Table_8\" | 2df11d3b06a2dadde28e6bed512dd5a6cba60c5f26a26a50d83f1b25477bf131 | missing |\n| \"Table_9\" | 8bc1cbadbb5e4a2ee0d50691060bae96447dae4292df9fe0640269f6109d737f | missing |\n| \"Table_10\" | 4495c5dd95fb555d089a4997d421f21b555e0a1bc9f04f315b279c33337e122d | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
